# Smart Contract Security Audit Report
## SRP (Security Reasoning Protocol)
**Audit Date:** 2026-03-22  
**Protocol:** AI-powered smart contract security analysis with x402-compatible budget management  
**Scope:** SRPBudget.sol, SRPPolicy.sol  
**Trace ID:** 9035cf86-8c36-4fa4-8f04-2e5805d6a41a

